        </p>
        <button type="submit" id="btnSalvarCfg" class="bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-500 text-white text-[12px] font-semibold px-5 py-2 rounded-[6px] shadow-xs transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer">
            <i class="ph ph-floppy-disk font-bold"></i> Salvar Configurações
        </button>
